  "details": "To better accommodate language-specific grammatical nuances, I’d like to be able to use placeholders in the string to insert a name more naturally.\n\nFor Japanese, phrases like 「(username)が撮影」 or 「(username)によって撮影」 would provide a smoother and more context-appropriate expression. However, since the position of the username cannot be controlled, we translated it as 「撮影者: (username)」. Unfortunately, we don’t prefer this solution because it feels formal and lacks the casual tone we’re aiming for.",
